REMELEM — Greedy / Min-Max Observation

Core Idea

Only the minimum element needs to pair with the maximum.

If:
min + max <= K → YES
else → NO

Recognition Trigger

When an operation allows removing an element if:

Ai + Aj <= K

Think: Can the smallest element pair with the largest?

Pattern

min_element + max_element <= K

Special case:
N == 1 → YES

Complexity

Time: O(N)
Space: O(1)

Memory Trick

Smallest + Largest ≤ K → keep deleting the largest → YES.
